WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:06.880
1 in 4 people have a hole in their heart.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:14.840
59 of the 60 oldest living people are women.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:21.029
A newborn blue whale puts on 14 stone every
day.

00:00:21.029 --> 00:00:25.810
To sleep for one night in every bed in Las
Vegas would take 288 years.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:33.250
A common form of public apology in Japan is
shaving one's head.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:40.290
Full-fat or whole milk only contains 3.5%
fat.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:46.100
The critically endangered Kakapo bird has
a strong, pleasant, musty odour which allows

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.840
predators to easily locate it.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.220
Hence, it is critically endangered.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:57.330
Two teaspoonfuls of Botox are enough to kill
everyone in Britain.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:03.670
The hole in the ozone layer over Antarctica
is twice the size of Europe.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:11.549
Arnold Schwarzenegger earned more than £20,000
per word for his role in Terminator 2.

00:01:11.549 --> 00:01:19.540
In spite of 'women and children first', men
are twice as likely as women to survive shipwrecks.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:25.840
During 19th century construction of Paris's
underground sewers, workers found lost medieval

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:32.659
dungeons, jewels, and the skeleton of an orangutan
that had previously escaped from the zoo.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:39.490
The richest 85 people in the world have as
much money as the poorest 3.5 billion.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:46.380
The Dutch Crown jewels are made of fake pearls,
fish scales and coloured foil.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:52.469
80% of Italians under 30 years old live with
their parents.

00:01:52.469 --> 00:02:00.179
In 2013, a PayPal computer error briefly made
a man in Pennsylvania the richest person in

00:02:00.179 --> 00:02:04.310
the world.

